                                "sense_id": "9045bdf5-5fa5-35ec-8f66-1097363d6dfa",
                                "text": "I lay there so close I could've reached out in any direction and just grabbed a nork."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8581e605-d79a-43a5-8a10-84d79f7471a7",
                                "sense_id": "9045bdf5-5fa5-35ec-8f66-1097363d6dfa",
                                "text": "Ernie constantly badgered me to get her to talk to him but I suspected she would throttle him if he merely glanced in the direction of her norks."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f42daeaa-974e-4f1a-b4de-eee085be6bd8",
                                "sense_id": "9045bdf5-5fa5-35ec-8f66-1097363d6dfa",
                                "text": "And her norks! Like a hundred times bigger than his sister's. Why was he thinking about his sister's norks? Gross."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
